  "details": "There is a trend of standalone devices coming out to compete against the quest2 such as lynx R1 (which can also do PC VR), vive flow, etc. knowing these devices tend to use snapdragon, it would be nice to have a way to empower this newer devices to also work with Vrchat as standalones. I am not sure if this means vrchat needs to be available on more platforms. Like vive flow really didn’t get it right given they show vrchat on the library but it doesn’t actually work.",
